        "code": "<!-- 1. File: /AGENTS.md (Single Source of Truth cho ca repo) -->\n# DOMATION Monorepo Engineering Standards\n- Stack: Next.js 14+, TypeScript strict, PostgreSQL FORCE RLS, Three.js, MISA & Meta CAPI.\n- Luon chay `npm run typecheck` va `npm test` truoc khi ket thuc task.\n- Cam tuyet doi hardcode API key trong code hoac `.mcp.json`; dung `${ENV_VAR}`.\n\n## Code Review Rules\n- Tu choi PR neu migration SQL thieu `ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY` va `FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY`.\n- Canh bao neu thay SDK cu `@google/generative-ai`; bat buoc dung `@google/genai >= 3.2.0`.\n- Moi endpoint ghi hoa don MISA hoac Meta CAPI bat buoc phai co Idempotency Key va Audit Log.\n\n<!-- 2. File: /CLAUDE.md (Tranh bay v2.1.277 bo qua AGENTS.md khi cung o root) -->\n@./AGENTS.md\n\n## Claude Code Specific Directives\n- Uu tien dung `/plan` truoc khi sua nhieu hon 3 tep hoac thay doi DB schema.\n- Khi task doc lap tren ERP module, chay trong subagent `isolation: worktree`.\n\n<!-- 3. File: /.claude/rules/postgres-rls.md (Chi nap khi cham toi SQL migrations) -->\n---\npaths:\n  - \"supabase/migrations/**/*.sql\"\n  - \"src/db/schema/**/*.ts\"\n---\n# PostgreSQL Multi-Tenant FORCE RLS Rules\n- Moi bang tenant bat buoc loc theo `current_setting('app.tenant_id', true)::uuid`.\n- Khong dung role `postgres` hay `service_role` bo qua RLS trong luong API cua dai ly F1.\n\n<!-- 4. File: /.gemini/settings.json (Cho Gemini CLI doc AGENTS.md + GEMINI.md) -->\n{\n  \"context\": {\n    \"fileName\": [\"AGENTS.md\", \"GEMINI.md\"]\n  },\n  \"security\": {\n    \"folderTrust\": { \"enabled\": true }\n  }\n}\n\n<!-- 5. File: /.claude/skills/erp-misa-reconcile/SKILL.md (Chuan 3 tang agentskills.io) -->\n---\nname: erp-misa-reconcile\ndescription: Doi soat hoa don dien tu MISA voi CRM Pipeline 8 nac va xuat bao cao chenh lech theo tenantId.\ncompatibility: Claude Code, Codex CLI, Cursor, Antigravity\nargument-hint: \"[tenant-id] [thang-yyyy-mm]\"\nallowed-tools: Read, Grep, Bash(node scripts/verify-misa.mjs:*)\n---\n# Quy trinh doi soat MISA & CRM (Tier 2 < 5,000 tokens)\n1. Doc quy tac anh xa tai khoan ke toan trong `references/misa-mapping-2026.md` (chi doc khi can).\n2. Chay `node scripts/verify-misa.mjs --tenant=$1 --month=$2` (Tier 3 script, 0 startup token).\n3. Doi chieu cac don dang o buoc 6/8 Hop dong va 7/8 Xuat hoa don tren CRM.\n4. Tra ve bang tom tat chenh lech cong no khong chua PII tho.\n"
